## Article 384. Procedure for restoration of lost court proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article384RestorationProcedure:
  input check content LostProceedingsCheck
  output restorationAvailable content YesNo

scope Article384RestorationProcedure:
# Restoration available for lost proceedings
  label available definition restorationAvailable under condition
    (check.proceedingsFullyOrPartiallyLost = Yes)
    and (check.caseEndedByDecision = Yes
    or check.proceedingsClosed = Yes)
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_available definition restorationAvailable equals No
```

## Article 385. Persons with right to apply for restoration

```catala
declaration scope Article385RestorationRight:
  input check content LostProceedingsRightCheck
  output participantMayApply content YesNo
  output courtMayInitiate content YesNo

scope Article385RestorationRight:
# Case participant may apply
  label participant definition participantMayApply under condition
    check.isParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_participant definition participantMayApply equals No

# Court may initiate restoration
  label initiative definition courtMayInitiate under condition
    check.courtInitiative = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_initiative definition courtMayInitiate equals No
```

## Article 386. Jurisdiction for restoration application

```catala
declaration scope Article386RestorationJurisdiction:
  input check content LostProceedingsJurisdictionCheck
  output filedWithFirstInstance content YesNo

scope Article386RestorationJurisdiction:
# Filed with court that heard as first instance
  label first_instance definition filedWithFirstInstance under condition
    check.filedWithFirstInstance = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label wrong_court definition filedWithFirstInstance equals No
```

## Article 387. Form and content of restoration application

```catala
declaration scope Article387RestorationForm:
  input check content LostProceedingsFormCheck
  output applicationInProperForm content YesNo
  output mayBeFiledRegardlessOfStoragePeriod content YesNo
  output filingDeadlineForExecution content YesNo

scope Article387RestorationForm:
# Application in proper written form
  label proper definition applicationInProperForm under condition
    check.applicationInWrittenForm = Yes
    and check.specifiesProceedingToRestore = Yes
    and check.preservedDocumentsAttached = Yes
    and check.copiesForParticipantsAttached = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label improper definition applicationInProperForm equals No

# May be filed regardless of storage period
  label regardless definition mayBeFiledRegardlessOfStoragePeriod under condition
    check.regardlessOfStoragePeriod = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label storage_limited definition mayBeFiledRegardlessOfStoragePeriod equals No

# Filing deadline for execution purposes
  label within_deadline definition filingDeadlineForExecution under condition
    check.forExecutionPurposes = Yes
    and check.withinEnforcementDeadline = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_execution_filing definition filingDeadlineForExecution equals No
```

## Article 388. Consequences of non-compliance, leaving without consideration, refusal to open

```catala
declaration scope Article388RestorationNoncompliance:
  input check content LostProceedingsNoncomplianceCheck
  output returnedIfNonCompliant content YesNo
  output refusedIfProceedingsLostBeforeEnd content YesNo
  output resubmissionNotPrecluded content YesNo

scope Article388RestorationNoncompliance:
# Returned if non-compliant
  label returned definition returnedIfNonCompliant under condition
    check.applicationNonCompliant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label compliant definition returnedIfNonCompliant equals No

# Refused if proceedings lost before review ended
  label lost_before definition refusedIfProceedingsLostBeforeEnd under condition
    check.proceedingsLostBeforeReviewEnded = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label deadline_expired definition refusedIfProceedingsLostBeforeEnd under condition
    check.deadlineExpiredAndNotRestored = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_refused definition refusedIfProceedingsLostBeforeEnd equals No

# Resubmission not precluded
  label may_resubmit definition resubmissionNotPrecluded equals Yes
```

## Article 389. Consideration of restoration application

```catala
declaration scope Article389RestorationConsideration:
  input check content LostProceedingsConsiderationCheck
  output sufficientMaterialsForConsideration content YesNo

scope Article389RestorationConsideration:
# Sufficient materials available for consideration
  label preserved definition sufficientMaterialsForConsideration under condition
    check.preservedMaterialsExist = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label court_documents definition sufficientMaterialsForConsideration under condition
    check.documentsFromCourtExist = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label enforcement definition sufficientMaterialsForConsideration under condition
    check.enforcementMaterialsExist = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label other_documents definition sufficientMaterialsForConsideration under condition
    check.otherDocumentsSufficient = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label registry definition sufficientMaterialsForConsideration under condition
    check.registryDataAvailable = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label e_court definition sufficientMaterialsForConsideration under condition
    check.eCourtDataAvailable = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label insufficient definition sufficientMaterialsForConsideration equals No
```

## Article 390. Court decision following consideration of restoration application

```catala
declaration scope Article390RestorationDecision:
  input check content LostProceedingsDecisionCheck
  output mayRestoreFullyOrPartially content YesNo
  output refusesIfInsufficient content YesNo

scope Article390RestorationDecision:
# May restore fully or partially
  label restore definition mayRestoreFullyOrPartially under condition
    check.materialsSufficientForRestoration = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_restore definition mayRestoreFullyOrPartially equals No

# Refuses if insufficient materials
  label insufficient definition refusesIfInsufficient under condition
    check.materialsSufficientForRestoration = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label sufficient definition refusesIfInsufficient equals No
```

## Article 391. Exemption from court costs

```catala
declaration scope Article391RestorationCosts:
  input check content LostProceedingsCostsCheck
  output applicantExemptFromCosts content YesNo
  output costsIfFalseApplication content YesNo

scope Article391RestorationCosts:
# Applicant exempt from court costs
  label exempt definition applicantExemptFromCosts under condition
    check.applicantExemptFromCosts = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_exempt definition applicantExemptFromCosts equals No

# Costs imposed if knowingly false application
  label false_application definition costsIfFalseApplication under condition
    check.applicationKnowinglyFalse = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label truthful definition costsIfFalseApplication equals No
```
